      "description": "A Black man in a suit (Al Sharpton) is prominently featured in the foreground, pointing forward with an expressive face, while a blurred portrait of Martin Luther King Jr. is visible in the background. Text overlays state 'if trump gets elected, i'm leaving the country!' and 'like and share if you think i should leave.' The scene depicts a political declaration framed by historical symbolism.",
