      "instance_name": "al_sharpton",
      "label": "Al Sharpton",
      "description": "Al Sharpton is a prominent American civil rights activist, clergyman, and television host. He is known for his advocacy on social justice issues and his role in the Black Lives Matter movement. His image in the meme is used to evoke his authority and connection to civil rights history, which is central to the meme's message.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
