      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "donald_trump",
      "label": "Donald Trump",
      "description": "Donald Trump is an American businessman, television personality, and politician who served as the 45th president of the United States from 2017 to 2021. His political career and presidency are central to the meme's political statement, as the text references his potential election as a catalyst for the speaker's decision to leave the country.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
